{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Planetiny is a relaxing idle game with Desktop Mode for work or study. Discover planets, collect Tinies, feed them and upgrade planets to boost productivity, and optimize by replacing the less productive ones. Enjoy Chill or LoFi music and customizable ambient sound layers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/c564ba43f8666526a53f3af9ec09cc39.poster.avif?t=1772734551\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/c564ba43f8666526a53f3af9ec09cc39.webm?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/c564ba43f8666526a53f3af9ec09cc39.mp4?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock up to 5 colorful galaxies and add up to 6 planets in each one. Every planet has unique shapes and hosts one of 18 beautifully crafted landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COLLECT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/f1e5cd5e88f015120fe127798e6b4e08.poster.avif?t=1772734551\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/f1e5cd5e88f015120fe127798e6b4e08.webm?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/f1e5cd5e88f015120fe127798e6b4e08.mp4?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">18 races of Tinies, with 4 rarities and 3 levels each. Build your own cosmic collection with thousands of unique combinations thanks to light procedural generation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BOOST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/e393df39da50467fc0fcff4e2023a42f.poster.avif?t=1772734551\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/e393df39da50467fc0fcff4e2023a42f.webm?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/e393df39da50467fc0fcff4e2023a42f.mp4?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feed Tinies for one-time productivity boosts. Upgrade planets for permanent increases. Master both to maximize your resource production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OPTIMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/5224b6ca3d53c12c1023e588bdd736d7.poster.avif?t=1772734551\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/5224b6ca3d53c12c1023e588bdd736d7.webm?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/5224b6ca3d53c12c1023e588bdd736d7.mp4?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sell planets and low-producing Tinies for resources, keep the highest producers, and set the pace at which your galaxy grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESKTOP MODE &amp; SOUND CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/51bfa4f065f9e3c4ebaaa9ca4e79367f.poster.avif?t=1772734551\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/51bfa4f065f9e3c4ebaaa9ca4e79367f.webm?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/51bfa4f065f9e3c4ebaaa9ca4e79367f.mp4?t=1772734551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize the soundscape and music to match your mood. Activate Desktop Mode to keep Planetiny always visible while you study, work, or do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A tiny galaxy that produces while you do.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507350?t=1772734551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507350?t=1772734551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/3e06a34d59034708e21d8c36475eb7155eaef695/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772734551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/3e06a34d59034708e21d8c36475eb7155eaef695/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772734551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_